1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,259
Your screenshots are full of things you need.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:05,574
Memoshot reads the text inside every screenshot.

3
00:00:07,433 --> 00:00:10,109
So one word finds the password you saved.

4
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,106
Copy a flight number, or add the date to your calendar.

5
00:00:15,767 --> 00:00:18,512
Receipts, tickets and codes sort themselves.

6
00:00:20,967 --> 00:00:23,892
Clear old codes and duplicates, only when you say so.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,634
Your screenshots and their text stay on your phone.

8
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:31,417
And search works even in airplane mode.

9
00:00:33,617 --> 00:00:36,767
Memoshot. Find any screenshot by what's in it.

